=== PROPOSED ARCHITECTURE ===
--- DATA SOURCES ---
pump_runtime=from FB_Heating_System_Manager / pump control
fan_runtime=from ventilation manager
start_count=increment on rising edge of device active

--- STORAGE ---
retain=GVL_Retain (preferred)
structure=array_of_ST_Lifetime_Status
index=device_id

--- PROCESSING ---
new_fb=FB_Lifetime_Manager
responsibility:
  - accumulate runtime_hours
  - count starts
  - compute remaining_hours
  - compute remaining_percent
  - set maintenance_required

--- INTEGRATION POINT ---
PRG_System:
  call FB_Lifetime_Manager
  pass system_time

--- HEALTH INTEGRATION ---
maintenance_required → FB_System_Health
possible mapping:
  warning when <20%
  critical when <5%

--- HMI ---
expose via GVL_Lifetime
fields:
  runtime_hours
  remaining_percent
  maintenance_required

--- DEVICE SET (INITIAL) ---
1 = pump
2 = ventilation fan

=== DESIGN RISKS ===
double counting runtime
incorrect wrap of UDINT time
retain overflow / wear

=== DESIGN DECISION ===
lifetime_cluster=KEEP_AND_IMPLEMENT
